-> start

=== start ===
I was paid to testify. The priests needed witnesses. They told me what to say.
* [What did you say?] -> testimony

=== testimony ===
I said I heard him say, "I will destroy this temple made with human hands and in three days will build another, not made with hands."
* [Was that true?] -> contradiction

=== contradiction ===
The problem was, the other witnesses said different things. Our testimonies didn't agree. The whole thing fell apart. They couldn't make the charges stick based on what we said.
-> DONE